{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21010","headline":"兰香神女庙 · 李贺","name":"兰香神女庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古春年年在，闲绿摇暖云。\n松香飞晚华，柳渚含日昏。\n沙砌落红满，石泉生水芹。\n幽篁画新粉，蛾绿横晓门。\n弱蕙不胜露，山秀愁空春。\n舞佩剪鸾翼，帐带涂轻银。\n兰桂吹浓香，菱藕长莘莘。\n看雨逢瑶姬，乘船值江君。\n吹箫饮酒醉，结绶金丝裙。\n走天呵白鹿，游水鞭锦鳞。\n密发虚鬟飞，腻颊凝花匀。\n团鬓分蛛巢，穠眉笼小唇。\n弄蝶和轻妍，风光怯腰身。\n深帏金鸭冷，奁镜幽凤尘。\n踏雾乘风归，撼玉山上闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}